[{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{8x+23}{x+2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A+\\dfrac B{x+2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\int f(x)\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{8x+23}{x+2}\\equiv A+\\dfrac B{x+2}\\Rightarrow8x+23\\equiv A(x+2)+B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"7=B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"23=2A+7\\Rightarrow A=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac{8x+23}{x+2}\\equiv8+\\dfrac7{x+2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int\\frac{8x+23}{x+2}\\,dx=\\int\\left(8+\\frac7{x+2}\\right)dx=8x+7\\ln|x+2|+c.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{2x^2-2x-1}{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Ax+B+\\dfrac C{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\int f(x)\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{2x^2-2x-1}{x+1}\\equiv Ax+B+\\dfrac C{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2x^2-2x-1\\equiv Ax(x+1)+B(x+1)+C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3=C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-1=B+3\\Rightarrow B=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-1=2A+2(-4)+3\\Rightarrow A=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac{2x^2-2x-1}{x+1}\\equiv2x-4+\\dfrac3{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int\\frac{2x^2-2x-1}{x+1}\\,dx=\\int\\left(2x-4+\\frac3{x+1}\\right)dx=x^2-4x+3\\ln|x+1|+c.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q3","number":3,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac4{(x-3)(x+1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as partial fractions.</p></li><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac4{(x-3)(x+1)}\\,dx=\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-3}{x+1}\\right|+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac4{(x-3)(x+1)}\\equiv\\dfrac A{x-3}+\\dfrac B{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4\\equiv A(x+1)+B(x-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4=4A\\Rightarrow A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4=-4B\\Rightarrow B=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac4{(x-3)(x+1)}\\equiv\\dfrac1{x-3}-\\dfrac1{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int\\frac4{(x-3)(x+1)}dx=\\int\\left(\\frac1{x-3}-\\frac1{x+1}\\right)dx=\\ln|x-3|-\\ln|x+1|+c=\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-3}{x+1}\\right|+c.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q4","number":4,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{10}{25-x^2}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_{-1}^1\\frac{10}{25-x^2}\\,dx=\\ln\\frac ab\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers to be found.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{10}{25-x^2}=\\dfrac{10}{(5-x)(5+x)}\\equiv\\dfrac A{5-x}+\\dfrac B{5+x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10\\equiv A(5+x)+B(5-x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10=10A\\Rightarrow A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10=10B\\Rightarrow B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{10}{25-x^2}dx =\\int\\left(\\frac1{5-x}+\\frac1{5+x}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\ln|5-x|+\\ln|5+x|+c=\\ln\\left|\\frac{5+x}{5-x}\\right|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_{-1}^1\\frac{10}{25-x^2}dx =\\left[\\ln\\left|\\frac{5+x}{5-x}\\right|\\right]_{-1}^1=\\ln\\frac64-\\ln\\frac46\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left(\\frac64\\times\\frac64\\right)=\\ln\\frac{36}{16}=\\ln\\frac94.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q5","number":5,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{2x-1}{(x+5)(x-6)}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_7^k\\frac{2x-1}{(x+5)(x-6)}\\,dx=\\ln5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{2x-1}{(x+5)(x-6)}\\equiv\\dfrac A{x+5}+\\dfrac B{x-6}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2x-1\\equiv A(x-6)+B(x+5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-11=-11A\\Rightarrow A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"11=11B\\Rightarrow B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int\\frac{2x-1}{(x+5)(x-6)}dx=\\int\\left(\\frac1{x+5}+\\frac1{x-6}\\right)dx=\\ln|x+5|+\\ln|x-6|+c.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_7^k\\frac{2x-1}{(x+5)(x-6)}dx =\\ln5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n[\\ln|x+5|+\\ln|x-6|]_7^k =\\ln5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\ln|k+5|+\\ln|k-6|-(\\ln|7+5|+\\ln|7-6|) =\\ln5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\ln((k+5)(k-6))-\\ln12 =\\ln5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\ln((k+5)(k-6)) =\\ln12+\\ln5=\\ln60\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(k+5)(k-6) =60\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nk^2-k-30=60\\Rightarrow k^2-k-90 =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(k-10)(k+9)=0\\Rightarrow k=10\\text{ or }k =-9.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, we must have <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q6","number":6,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{k-4x}{x(2-x)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as partial fractions, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive constant.</p></li><li><p>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_3^4\\frac{k-4x}{x(2-x)}\\,dx=\\ln\\frac{128}{27}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{k-4x}{x(2-x)}\\equiv\\dfrac A x+\\dfrac B{2-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k-4x\\equiv A(2-x)+Bx\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=2A\\Rightarrow A=\\frac k2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k-8=2B\\Rightarrow B=\\frac{k-8}2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac{k-4x}{x(2-x)}\\equiv\\dfrac{k/2}x+\\dfrac{(k-8)/2}{2-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_3^4\\frac{k-4x}{x(2-x)}dx =\\int_3^4\\left(\\frac{k/2}x+\\frac{(k-8)/2}{2-x}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left[\\frac k2\\ln|x|-\\frac{k-8}2\\ln|2-x|\\right]_3^4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(\\frac k2\\ln|4|-\\frac{k-8}2\\ln|2-4|\\right)-\\left(\\frac k2\\ln|3|-\\frac{k-8}2\\ln|2-3|\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(\\frac k2\\ln4-\\frac{k-8}2\\ln2\\right)-\\left(\\frac k2\\ln3-\\frac{k-8}2\\ln1\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac k2\\ln4-\\frac{k-8}2\\ln2-\\frac k2\\ln3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac k2\\ln4-\\frac k2\\ln2+4\\ln2-\\frac k2\\ln3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac k2(\\ln4-\\ln2-\\ln3)+4\\ln2=\\frac k2\\ln\\frac23+4\\ln2.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac k2\\ln\\frac23+4\\ln2=\\ln\\frac{128}{27} \\Rightarrow\\frac k2\\ln\\frac23=\\ln\\frac{128}{27}-\\ln16\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac k2\\ln\\frac23=\\ln\\frac8{27} \\Rightarrow\\ln\\left(\\frac23\\right)^{k/2}=\\ln\\frac8{27}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\left(\\frac23\\right)^{k/2}=\\frac8{27}=\\left(\\frac23\\right)^3 \\Rightarrow\\frac k2=3\\Rightarrow k=6.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q7","number":7,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{23x+11}{(3-x)(x+2)(3x-1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as partial fractions.</p></li><li><p>Write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_1^2\\frac{23x+11}{(3-x)(x+2)(3x-1)}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive constant.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{23x+11}{(3-x)(x+2)(3x-1)}\\equiv\\dfrac A{3-x}+\\dfrac B{x+2}+\\dfrac C{3x-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"23x+11\\equiv A(x+2)(3x-1)+B(3-x)(3x-1)+C(3-x)(x+2).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"80=40A\\Rightarrow A=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-35=-35B\\Rightarrow B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{56}3=\\frac{56}9C\\Rightarrow C=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac{23x+11}{(3-x)(x+2)(3x-1)}\\equiv\\dfrac2{3-x}+\\dfrac1{x+2}+\\dfrac3{3x-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_1^2\\frac{23x+11}{(3-x)(x+2)(3x-1)}dx =\\int_1^2\\left(\\frac2{3-x}+\\frac1{x+2}+\\frac3{3x-1}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =[-2\\ln|3-x|+\\ln|x+2|+\\ln|3x-1|]_1^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(-2\\ln|3-2|+\\ln|2+2|+\\ln|3\\times2-1|)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\quad-(-2\\ln|3-1|+\\ln|1+2|+\\ln|3\\times1-1|)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(-2\\ln1+\\ln4+\\ln5)-(-2\\ln2+\\ln3+\\ln2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(\\ln1+\\ln4+\\ln5)-(\\ln\\tfrac14+\\ln3+\\ln2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln20-\\ln\\frac32=\\ln\\frac{40}3.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q8","number":8,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{4x^2+1}{x^2(2x+1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as partial fractions.</p></li><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{4x^2+1}{x^2(2x+1)}\\,dx=\\frac ax+\\ln f(x)+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is an integer to be found.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{4x^2+1}{x^2(2x+1)}\\equiv\\dfrac Ax+\\dfrac B{x^2}+\\dfrac C{2x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4x^2+1\\equiv Ax(2x+1)+B(2x+1)+Cx^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2=\\frac14C\\Rightarrow C=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5=3A+3+8\\Rightarrow A=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac{4x^2+1}{x^2(2x+1)}\\equiv-\\dfrac2x+\\dfrac1{x^2}+\\dfrac8{2x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{4x^2+1}{x^2(2x+1)}dx =\\int\\left(-\\frac2x+\\frac1{x^2}+\\frac8{2x+1}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-2\\ln|x|-\\frac1x+4\\ln|2x+1|+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\frac1x+\\ln(2x+1)^4-\\ln x^2+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\frac1x+\\ln\\left(\\frac{(2x+1)^4}{x^2}\\right)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q9","number":9,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{4x-2}{(x-2)^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac A{x-2}+\\dfrac B{(x-2)^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants.</p></li><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_3^4\\frac{4x-2}{(x-2)^2}\\,dx=a+\\ln b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers to be found.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{4x-2}{(x-2)^2}\\equiv\\dfrac A{x-2}+\\dfrac B{(x-2)^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4x-2\\equiv A(x-2)+B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6=B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-2=-2A+6\\Rightarrow A=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac{4x-2}{(x-2)^2}\\equiv\\dfrac4{x-2}+\\dfrac6{(x-2)^2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_3^4\\frac{4x-2}{(x-2)^2}dx =\\int_3^4\\left(\\frac4{x-2}+\\frac6{(x-2)^2}\\right)dx=\\left[4\\ln|x-2|-\\frac6{x-2}\\right]_3^4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(4\\ln|4-2|-\\frac6{4-2}\\right)-\\left(4\\ln|3-2|-\\frac6{3-2}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(4\\ln2-3)-(4\\ln1-6)=4\\ln2-3+6=3+4\\ln2=3+\\ln16.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q10","number":10,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{10x^2+6}{(x+1)^2(3x-1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as partial fractions.</p></li><li><p>Hence show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_1^{5/3}\\frac{10x^2+6}{(x+1)^2(3x-1)}\\,dx=a+b\\ln2+c\\ln9\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants to be found.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{10x^2+6}{(x+1)^2(3x-1)}\\equiv\\dfrac A{x+1}+\\dfrac B{(x+1)^2}+\\dfrac C{3x-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"10x^2+6\\equiv A(x+1)(3x-1)+B(3x-1)+C(x+1)^2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"16=-4B\\Rightarrow B=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{64}9=\\frac{16}9C\\Rightarrow C=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6=-A+4+4\\Rightarrow A=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac{10x^2+6}{(x+1)^2(3x-1)}\\equiv\\dfrac2{x+1}-\\dfrac4{(x+1)^2}+\\dfrac4{3x-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_1^{5/3}\\frac{10x^2+6}{(x+1)^2(3x-1)}dx =\\int_1^{5/3}\\left(\\frac2{x+1}-\\frac4{(x+1)^2}+\\frac4{3x-1}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left[2\\ln|x+1|+\\frac4{x+1}+\\frac43\\ln|3x-1|\\right]_1^{5/3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(2\\ln|\\tfrac53+1|+\\frac4{5/3+1}+\\frac43\\ln|3\\times\\tfrac53-1|\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\quad-\\left(2\\ln|1+1|+\\frac4{1+1}+\\frac43\\ln|3\\times1-1|\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(2\\ln\\frac83+\\frac32+\\frac43\\ln4\\right)-\\left(2\\ln2+2+\\frac43\\ln2\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(2(\\ln8-\\ln3)+\\frac32+\\frac43\\ln4\\right)-\\left(2\\ln2+2+\\frac43\\ln2\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(2\\ln8-2\\ln3+\\frac32+\\frac43\\ln4\\right)-\\left(2\\ln2+2+\\frac43\\ln2\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(6\\ln2-2\\ln3+\\frac32+\\frac83\\ln2\\right)-\\left(2\\ln2+2+\\frac43\\ln2\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(\\frac{26}3\\ln2-2\\ln3+\\frac32\\right)-\\left(\\frac{10}3\\ln2+2\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\frac12+\\frac{16}3\\ln2-\\ln9.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>The diagram below shows the curve with equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\frac{x^2+5x+6}{x^2(2-x)},\\qquad x\\ne0,\\ x\\ne2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>Find the exact value of the shaded area.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-2.38/questions/assets/diagrams/238-q11.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2+5x+6}{x^2(2-x)}=0\\Rightarrow x^2+5x+6=0\\Rightarrow(x+2)(x+3)=0\\Rightarrow x=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2+5x+6}{x^2(2-x)}\\equiv\\dfrac Ax+\\dfrac B{x^2}+\\dfrac C{2-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+5x+6\\equiv Ax(2-x)+B(2-x)+Cx^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6=2B\\Rightarrow B=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"20=4C\\Rightarrow C=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12=A+3+5\\Rightarrow A=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac{x^2+5x+6}{x^2(2-x)}\\equiv\\dfrac4x+\\dfrac3{x^2}+\\dfrac5{2-x}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_{-3}^{-2}\\frac{x^2+5x+6}{x^2(2-x)}dx =\\int_{-3}^{-2}\\left(\\frac4x+\\frac3{x^2}+\\frac5{2-x}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left[4\\ln|x|-\\frac3x-5\\ln|2-x|\\right]_{-3}^{-2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(4\\ln|-2|-\\frac3{-2}-5\\ln|2-(-2)|\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\quad-\\left(4\\ln|-3|-\\frac3{-3}-5\\ln|2-(-3)|\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(4\\ln2+\\tfrac32-5\\ln4)-(4\\ln3+1-5\\ln5)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =4\\ln2-5\\ln4-4\\ln3+5\\ln5+\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln16-\\ln1024-\\ln81+\\ln3125+\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left(\\frac{16\\times3125}{1024\\times81}\\right)+\\frac12=\\ln\\frac{3125}{5184}+\\frac12.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> Area <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"=-\\left(\\ln\\frac{3125}{5184}+\\frac12\\right)=\\ln\\frac{5184}{3125}-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Find the exact value of</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\lim_{\\delta x\\to0}\\sum_{x=0}^{1/8}\\frac{360x^2+157x+16}{(3x+1)(2-5x)(8x+3)}\\,\\delta x.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{360x^2+157x+16}{(3x+1)(2-5x)(8x+3)}\\equiv\\dfrac A{3x+1}+\\dfrac B{2-5x}+\\dfrac C{8x+3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"360x^2+157x+16\\equiv A(2-5x)(8x+3)+B(3x+1)(8x+3)+C(3x+1)(2-5x).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{11}3=\\frac{11}9A\\Rightarrow A=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac25\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{682}5=\\frac{341}{25}B\\Rightarrow B=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac38\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{31}4=-\\frac{31}{64}C\\Rightarrow C=-16\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac{360x^2+157x+16}{(3x+1)(2-5x)(8x+3)}\\equiv\\dfrac3{3x+1}+\\dfrac{10}{2-5x}-\\dfrac{16}{8x+3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lim_{\\delta x\\to0}\\sum_{x=0}^{1/8}\\frac{360x^2+157x+16}{(3x+1)(2-5x)(8x+3)}\\delta x\n =\\int_0^{1/8}\\frac{360x^2+157x+16}{(3x+1)(2-5x)(8x+3)}dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\int_0^{1/8}\\left(\\frac3{3x+1}+\\frac{10}{2-5x}-\\frac{16}{8x+3}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =[\\ln|3x+1|-2\\ln|2-5x|-2\\ln|8x+3|]_0^{1/8}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left(\\ln|3\\times\\tfrac18+1|-2\\ln|2-5\\times\\tfrac18|-2\\ln|8\\times\\tfrac18+3|\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\quad-(\\ln|3\\times0+1|-2\\ln|2-5\\times0|-2\\ln|8\\times0+3|)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(\\ln\\tfrac{11}8-2\\ln\\tfrac{11}8-2\\ln4)-(\\ln1-2\\ln2-2\\ln3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(-\\ln\\tfrac{11}8-2\\ln4)-(-2\\ln2-2\\ln3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(\\ln\\tfrac8{11}-\\ln16)-(\\ln\\tfrac14-\\ln9)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\frac1{22}-\\ln\\frac1{36}=\\ln\\frac{18}{11}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q13","number":13,"question":"<p><strong>Prerequisite knowledge for Q13--Q14: Integration by Substitution</strong> Use the substitution <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\sqrt{x}-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to find</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int\\frac9{2(\\sqrt{x}-2)(\\sqrt{x}+1)(\\sqrt{x}+4)}\\,dx.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=x^{1/2}-2\\Rightarrow\\dfrac{du}{dx}=\\frac12x^{-1/2}\\Rightarrow dx=2x^{1/2}du\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=x^{1/2}-2\\Rightarrow x^{1/2}=u+2\\Rightarrow dx=2(u+2)du\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac9{2(\\sqrt{x}-2)(\\sqrt{x}+1)(\\sqrt{x}+4)}dx\n =\\int\\frac9{2u((u+2)+1)((u+2)+4)}\\times2(u+2)du\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\int\\frac{9(u+2)}{u(u+3)(u+6)}du.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{9(u+2)}{u(u+3)(u+6)}\\equiv\\dfrac Au+\\dfrac B{u+3}+\\dfrac C{u+6}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"9(u+2)\\equiv A(u+3)(u+6)+Bu(u+6)+Cu(u+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"18=18A\\Rightarrow A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-9=-9B\\Rightarrow B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=-6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-36=18C\\Rightarrow C=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\dfrac{9(u+2)}{u(u+3)(u+6)}\\equiv\\dfrac1u+\\dfrac1{u+3}-\\dfrac2{u+6}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{9(u+2)}{u(u+3)(u+6)}du =\\int\\left(\\frac1u+\\frac1{u+3}-\\frac2{u+6}\\right)du\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln|u|+\\ln|u+3|-2\\ln|u+6|+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln|\\sqrt{x}-2|+\\ln|\\sqrt{x}-2+3|-2\\ln|\\sqrt{x}-2+6|+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln|\\sqrt{x}-2|+\\ln|\\sqrt{x}+1|-2\\ln|\\sqrt{x}+4|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year2-2.38-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Use the substitution <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=\\sqrt{x-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int_3^6\\frac6{(3+2\\sqrt{x-2})(x-2)}\\,dx=4\\ln\\frac{10}7.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=(x-2)^{1/2}\\Rightarrow\\dfrac{du}{dx}=\\frac12(x-2)^{-1/2}\\Rightarrow dx=2(x-2)^{1/2}du=2u\\,du\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=(x-2)^{1/2}\\Rightarrow u^2=x-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Change limits: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=6\\Rightarrow u=(6-2)^{1/2}=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=3\\Rightarrow u=(3-2)^{1/2}=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int_3^6\\frac6{(3+2\\sqrt{x-2})(x-2)}dx=\\int_1^1\\frac6{(3+2u)u^2}\\times2u\\,du=\\int_1^1\\frac{12}{(3+2u)u}du.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{12}{(3+2u)u}\\equiv\\dfrac A{3+2u}+\\dfrac Bu\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12\\equiv Au+B(3+2u)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=-\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12=-\\frac32A\\Rightarrow A=-8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12=3B\\Rightarrow B=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_1^1\\frac{12}{(3+2u)u}du =\\int_1^1\\left(-\\frac8{3+2u}+\\frac4u\\right)du\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =[-4\\ln|3+2u|+4\\ln|u|]_1^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(-4\\ln|3+2\\times2|+4\\ln|2|)-(-4\\ln|3+2\\times1|+4\\ln|1|)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(-4\\ln7+4\\ln2)-(-4\\ln5+4\\ln1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =4\\ln2-4\\ln7+4\\ln5=4(\\ln2-\\ln7+\\ln5)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =4\\ln\\left(\\frac{2\\times5}7\\right)=4\\ln\\frac{10}7.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]